# deps
/node_modules

# generated content
.source
# `content/docs/reference/` is auto-generated by site/scripts/build-{command,schema}-reference.mjs.
# `lib/stats.json` is auto-generated by site/scripts/build-stats.mjs.
# Both ARE committed because Vercel uploads only `site/` (not the monorepo plugins/ siblings),
# so the build step on Vercel can't regenerate them from source. Run
# `pnpm --filter @maude/site gen:reference` and `pnpm --filter @maude/site gen:stats`
# after editing plugin assets or .mdx pages and commit the diff. CI guards drift.

# test & build
/coverage
